 "_note": "The request paths of row 19 (plan-coverage.md rule 6, AA5), named before any timing from the HTTP API of docs/poc/stockroom.md and of api/web in both base apps. Each run starts a fresh process on an empty database, so the ids in the paths (o-1, s-1, po-1, wh-1) are the first of their kind. 'setup' requests run once per run, untimed. The request is repeated 100 to 700 times on that process: each one is a read of data that does not grow, or a write that is valid every time (a fresh row, or one more unit of an amount of 10,000 or more). A path that can only be sent once (pay, ship, cancel, create a product) is not named. The webhook subscriptions of the setup point at port 19090, the card-processor helper of commands.json (constants.pay_port). The same status is expected in P and V.",
